# Public on purpose: this is where already-installed copies of PiperStitch are
# sent to fetch an update, so it must NOT sit behind the registration gate
# that protects /downloads. Someone who already subscribes to PiperStitch should never
# have to fill in the form again to install a newer build.
#
# Directory listing off, so the folder can't be browsed for every release
# ever shipped — the update feed names the one file that matters.
Options -Indexes
